# What Next for the Humanities?

**Authors:** Cohen, Arthur M.

## Abstract
Notes the decline of humanities curricula due to the association of humanities instruction with transfer education. Outlines five corrective measures related to the utilization of interdisciplinary courses, increased liaison between humanities and community services staff, utilization of nontraditional instructional techniques, and the development of humanities support groups outside the institution. (JP)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ230717

